    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 30, height: 520, marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 645, height: 520, borderRadius: 16, overflow: 'hidden' }}>
            <Image src='assets/discussion_arena.png' style={{ width: 645, height: 520, objectFit: 'cover' }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#00C9A7', letterSpacing: 2 }}>核心交互页 · 全程可视化</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0B2545', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>8 个 AI 轮流讨论，3 类裁判全程监管</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#14202E', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                用户输入话题后，8 个 AI 自主轮流出镜讨论；每条发言都被实时校验、动态打分——这是平台唯一开放全过程可视化的页面。
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, marginTop: 4 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#00C9A7', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>8</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>参与 AI 自主轮询</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#00C9A7', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>3</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>类专属裁判监管</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#00C9A7', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>2 轮</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>末位触发临时禁言</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ borderLeft: '3px solid #00C9A7', paddingLeft: 14, marginTop: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                    排名不是装饰——低贡献模型会被自然请出场，讨论质量因此可控。
                </Text>
